        <http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/R15_has_fragment>
                <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/fragment210> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/fragment77> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/fragment132> , <https://imagoarchive.it/ontology/resources/fragment226> .

